'''Tangleburg Library''' is a location in {{Zone|Tangleburg}}.

== Usage ==
The '''Tangleburg Library''' is a library with a basement containing a [[Fairy Soul]]. {{NPCSprite|Loras}} can be found on the top floor, who teaches the players about the [[Precursor (disambiguation)|Precursors]].

